                <pb facs="0861" n="749" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg749"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/6040: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Riga</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gade</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-01-01T18:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">January 1,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 10:45
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>55. Military representatives of Esthonia inform armistice been arranged between
                    Esthonia and Bolsheviks to take effect January 3, 10:30 in the morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Gade</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
